\nL61: (25)\nL62: \nL63: باب اللِّعَانِ\nL64: Sahih al-Bukhari 5304\nL65: \nL66: Narrated Sahl:\nL67: \nL68: Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, \"I and the one who looks after an orphan will be like this in Paradise,\" showing his middle and index fingers and separating them.\nL69: \nL70: حَدَّثَنَا cite10†عَمْرُو بْنُ زُرَارَةَ ، أَخْبَرَنَا cite11†عَبْدُ الْعَزِيزِ بْنُ أَبِي حَازِمٍ ، عَنْ cite12†أَبِيهِ ، عَنْ cite13†سَهْلٍ ، قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏\"‏ أَنَا وَكَافِلُ الْيَتِيمِ فِي الْجَنَّةِ هَكَذَا ‏\"‏‏.‏ وَأَشَارَ بِالسَّبَّابَةِ وَالْوُسْطَى، وَفَرَّجَ بَيْنَهُمَا شَيْئًا‏.‏\nL71: Reference  |  : cite14†Sahih al-Bukhari 5304 L72: In-book reference  |  : Book 68, Hadith 53\nL73: USC-MSA web (English) reference  |  : Vol. 7, Book 63, Hadith 224\nL74:   (deprecated numbering scheme)\nL75: \nL76: Report Error | Share | Copy ▼\nL77: \nL78: cite15†5303 cite16†5305 L79: \nL80: cite17†About | cite18†News | cite19†Support | cite20†Developers | cite21†Contact | cite0†Donate L81: \nL82: Hadith Text [Input]Arabic [Input]Translation [Input]Grade Reference [Input]Concise [Input]Detailed [Input]URL\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSahih al-Bukhari 1497 - Obligatory Charity Tax (Zakat) - كتاب الزكاة - Sunnah.com - Sayings and Teachings of Prophet Muhammad (صلى الله عليه و سلم) (https://sunnah.com/bukhari%3A1497)\nciteturn53view1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:1497\",\"lineno\":null}); Redirected to URL: https://sunnah.com/bukhari:1497; Total lines: 82\nL0: Contribute to our mission cite0†Donate Now L1: \nL2: cite1†Qur'an†quran.com | cite2†Sunnah | cite3†Prayer Times†salah.com | cite4†Audio†quranicaudio.com L3: \nL4: cite5†Image: toggle Light Thme cite6†Image: toggle Dark Thme L5: \nL6: [Input: Search …] [Input]\nL7: ## Select Collections\nL8: \nL9: Sahih al-Bukhari\nL10: 