لى الله عليه وسلم إِذَا أَتَاهُ قَوْمٌ بِصَدَقَتِهِمْ قَالَ ‏\"‏ اللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى آلِ فُلاَنٍ ‏\"‏‏.‏ فَأَتَاهُ أَبِي بِصَدَقَتِهِ، فَقَالَ ‏\"‏ اللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى آلِ أَبِي أَوْفَى ‏\"‏‏.‏\nL70: Reference  |  : cite14†Sahih al-Bukhari 1497 L71: In-book reference  |  : Book 24, Hadith 97\nL72: USC-MSA web (English) reference  |  : Vol. 2, Book 24, Hadith 574\nL73:   (deprecated numbering scheme)\nL74: \nL75: Report Error | Share | Copy ▼\nL76: \nL77: cite15†1496 cite16†1498 L78: \nL79: cite17†About | cite18†News | cite19†Support | cite20†Developers | cite21†Contact | cite0†Donate L80: \nL81: Hadith Text [Input]Arabic [Input]Translation [Input]Grade Reference [Input]Concise [Input]Detailed [Input]URL\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSahih Muslim 2642a - The Book of Virtue, Enjoining Good Manners, and Joining of the Ties of Kinship - كتاب البر والصلة والآداب - Sunnah.com - Sayings and Teachings of Prophet Muhammad (صلى الله عليه و سلم) (https://sunnah.com/muslim%3A2642a)\nciteturn53view2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://sunnah.com/muslim:2642a\",\"lineno\":null}); Redirected to URL: https://sunnah.com/muslim:2642a; Total lines: 73\nL0: Contribute to our mission cite0†Donate Now L1: \nL2: cite1†Qur'an†quran.com | cite2†Sunnah | cite3†Prayer Times†salah.com | cite4†Audio†quranicaudio.com L3: \nL4: cite5†Image: toggle Light Thme cite6†Image: toggle Dark Thme L5: \nL6: [Input: Search …] [Input]\nL7: ## Select Collections\nL8: \nL9: Sahih al-Bukhari\nL10: \nL11: Sahih Muslim\nL12: \nL13: Sunan an-Nasa'i\nL14: \nL15: Sunan Abi Dawud\nL16: \nL17: Jami` at-Tirmidhi\nL18: \nL19: Sunan Ibn Majah\nL20: \nL21: Show More Collections\nL22: \nL23: [Button: Apply]\nL24: \nL25: Quotes e.g. \"pledge allegiance\"\nL26: Searches for the whole phrase instead of individual words\nL27: \nL28: Wildcards e.g. test*\nL29: Match