nL34: Boosts words with higher relevance. Here, the word pledge will have higher weight than hijrah\nL35: \nL36: Boolean Operators e.g. (\"pledge allegiance\" OR \"shelter) AND prayer\nL37: Create complex phrase and word queries by using Boolean logic.\nL38: \nL39: cite7†More ... L40: \nL41: cite2†Home » cite8†Sunan Ibn Majah » cite9†The Chapters on Pawning - كتاب الرهون » Hadith 2474\nL42: \nL43: كتاب الرهون\nL44: \nL45: 16\nL46: \nL47: The Chapters on Pawning\nL48: \nL49: (16)\nL50: \nL51: Chapter: The Muslims Are Partners In Three Things\nL52: \nL53: (16.00)\nL54: باب الْمُسْلِمُونَ شُرَكَاءُ فِي ثَلاَثٍ\nL55: \nL56: Sunan Ibn Majah 2474\nL57: \nL58: It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\nL59: “O Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), what are the things which are not permissible to withhold?” He said: “Water, salt and fire.” She said: “I said: 'O Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), we know what water is, but what about salt and fire?” He said: “O Humaira', whoever gives fire (to another), it is as if he has given in charity all the food that is cooked on that fire. And whoever gives salt, it is as if he has given in charity all that the salt makes good.\nL60: And whoever gives a Muslim water to drink when water is available, it is as if he freed a slave; and whoever gives a Muslim water to drink when there is no water available, it is as if he brought him back to life.”\nL61: حَدَّثَنَا cite10†عَمَّارُ بْنُ خَالِدٍ الْوَاسِطِيُّ ، حَدَّثَنَا cite11†عَلِيُّ بْنُ غُرَابٍ ، عَنْ cite12†زُهَيْرِ بْنِ مَرْزُوقٍ ، عَنْ cite13†عَلِيِّ بْنِ زَيْدِ بْنِ جُدْعَانَ ، عَنْ cite14†سَعِيدِ بْنِ الْمُسَيَّبِ ، عَنْ cite15†عَائِشَةَ ، أَنَّهَا قَالَتْ يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ مَا الشَّىْءُ الَّذِي لاَ يَحِلُّ مَنْعُهُ قَالَ الْمَاءُ وَالْمِلْحُ وَالنَّارُ ‏\"‏ ‏.‏ قَالَتْ قُلْتُ يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ هَذَا الْمَاءُ قَدْ عَرَفْنَاهُ فَمَا بَالُ الْمِلْحِ وَالنَّارِ قَالَ ‏\"‏ يَا حُمَيْرَاءُ مَنْ أَعْطَى نَارًا فَكَأَنَّمَا تَصَدَّقَ بِجَمِيعِ مَا أَنْضَجَتْ تِلْكَ النَّارُ وَمَنْ أَعْطَى مِلْحًا ‏.‏ فَكَأَنَّمَا تَصَدَّقَ بِجَمِيعِ مَا طَيَّبَ ذَلِكَ الْمِلْحُ وَمَنْ سَقَى مُسْلِمًا شَرْبَةً مِنْ مَاءٍ حَيْثُ يُوجَدُ الْمَاءُ فَكَأَنَّمَا أَعْتَقَ رَقَبَةً وَمَنْ سَقَى مُسْلِمًا شَرْبَةً مِنْ مَاءٍ حَيْثُ لاَ يُوجَدُ الْمَاءُ فَكَأَنَّمَا أَحْيَاهَا ‏\"‏ ‏.‏\nL62: Grade:  |  Da'if (Darussalam)  |  |\nL63: \nL64: Reference  |  : cite16†Sunan Ibn Majah 2474 L65: In-book reference  |  : Book 16, Hadith 39\nL66: English translation  |  : Vol. 3, Book 16, Hadith 2474\nL67: \nL68: Report Error | Share | Copy ▼\nL69: \nL70: cite17†2473 cite18†2475 L71: \nL72: cite19†About | cite20†News | cite21†Support | cite22†Developers | cite23†Contact | cite0†Donate L73: \nL74: Hadith Text [Input]Arabic [Input]Translation [Input]Grade Reference [Input]Concise [Input]Detailed [Input]URL\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSunan Ibn Majah 2473 - The Chapters on Pawning - كتاب الرهون - Sunnah.com - Sayings and Teachings of Prophet Muhammad (صلى الله عليه و سلم) (https://sunnah.com/ibnmajah%3A2473)\nciteturn53view4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://sunnah.com/ibnmajah:2473\",\"lineno\":null}); Redirected to URL: https://sunnah.com/ibnmajah:2473; Total lines: 76\nL0: Contribute to our mission cite0†Donate Now L1: \nL2: cite1†Qur'an†quran.com | cite2†Sunnah | cite3†Prayer Times†salah.com | cite4†Audio†quranicaudio.com L3: \nL4: cite5†Image: toggle Light Thme cite6†Image: toggle Dark Thme L5: \nL6: [Input: Search …] [Input]\nL7: ## Select Collections\nL8: \nL9: Sahih al-Bukhari\nL10: \nL11: Sahih Muslim\nL12: \nL13: Sunan an-Nasa'i\nL14: \nL15: Sunan Abi Dawud\nL16: \nL17: Jami` at-Tirmidhi\nL18: \nL19: Sunan Ibn Majah\nL20: \nL21: Show More Collections\nL22: \nL23: [Button: Apply]\nL24: \nL25: Quotes e.g. \"pledge allegiance\"\nL26: Searches for the whole phrase instead of individual words\nL27: \nL28: Wildcards e.